@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Callback Result Commit/Apply
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Intent Intake" as Receive
rectangle "Mutation Validation" as Validate
rectangle "Accepted Change Commit" as Commit
rectangle "Substrate Update Application" as Apply
rectangle "Bad Write Rejection" as Reject

Receive --> Validate : checks intents against
Validate --> Commit : admits valid write to
Commit --> Apply : writes substrate update through
Validate --> Reject : routes bad write to
@enduml
